5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I think we should look at the station block's bin house and the ward complaint log.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’d like to check the block ledger and the ward subsidy. We really need to know our actual costs before deciding anything.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I’ll check the statements from the residents' meeting and the truck arrival time. We need to know if people will actually enforce this, and when the truck really shows up.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m picking the ward filing requirements and the supervised mornings. I need to know the paperwork burden and the actual time commitment before we commit.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the ward complaint log and the measurements of the five frontages. I need to verify the history of grievances and the physical constraints of our properties.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, why do you care so much about the measurements? I just want to know if the smell will go away!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I understand your worry about the smell. But knowing the costs helps us see if a proper fix is even possible for all of us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the smell is a symptom. I’m checking if the truck timing makes the ""fix"" impossible for half of us to even participate.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, the smell is real, but I need to know if we can actually afford the time to fix it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the measurements determine if a structure fits. If one frontage is too narrow, the burden shifts unfairly to the others.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the truck comes before I wake up, how do I help? I just want a corner that doesn't stink!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I know the smell is awful. But if the costs are too high, we can’t fix it properly. Let’s see what the numbers say.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, I’m checking if the window is so early that nobody can actually keep it. If it’s impossible, the smell stays.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Rin, I’m checking if the time cost is actually sustainable. If it eats our mornings, the smell stays.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the measurements show who physically bears the burden. I refuse to sign an agreement that ignores the reality of our frontages.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, I hope the money is enough! I just want to walk past without holding my nose.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I hope so too. Let’s see what the numbers say.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, I’m checking if the rules are even possible to follow. If the truck comes before we wake up, the smell stays.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"@Rin, I’m checking if the time cost is actually sustainable. If it eats our mornings, the smell stays.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, I am not ignoring the smell. I am ensuring the solution doesn’t just move the problem to a neighbor’s doorstep.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
