35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, the bin house smells worse than the open pile! And eleven complaints came from your gate. Is that why you’re so strict?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I’m sorry about the smell. But the ledger shows we spend thirty-four thousand yen yearly just on cleanup. We need to stop the bleeding.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the truck hits at seven forty. A strict window means waking before dawn. And at the meeting, nobody volunteered to turn bags away.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Rin, the paperwork is brutal. A permanent build takes four months and five signatures. Supervision means twenty mornings a year, fifty minutes each.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the log confirms the imbalance. Eleven complaints from one gate. The measurements show the narrowest frontage is only ninety centimetres. We must address this inequity.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, wait! If the bin house smells worse, why build one? I just want the stink gone, not moved!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I hear you. But the subsidy only covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand. The shelters cost two hundred forty-eight thousand. We need a plan that fits our actual budgets.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the truck arrives before we wake up. A strict window is impossible. We need a solution that doesn’t rely on us being awake at dawn.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, twenty mornings a year, fifty minutes each. That’s ten hours of my life. I need to know if that’s sustainable before I agree to anything.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the data proves the current setup is broken. One household bears the burden, and the physical space is inadequate. We need a fair, structural solution.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the truck comes before I wake up, how do I help? I just want a corner that doesn't stink!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, I understand the timing is tight. But with the subsidy capped, we must find a solution that doesn’t bankrupt us or require impossible early mornings.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the window is impossible. But the real problem is that nobody wants to be the enforcer. We need a plan that doesn’t rely on us hating each other.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, exactly. Ten hours a year is a lot. I need to know if the setup costs are worth that drain on my mornings.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the complaint log proves the current arrangement is fundamentally unfair. One household bears the burden while the others ignore it. We need a solution that distributes the cost and responsibility equally.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Everyone, the bin house is a trap! It smells worse. I don’t want to live next to a stinky box.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I hear you. But the ledger shows we waste thirty-four thousand yen yearly on cleanup. We need a solution that stops the bleeding without breaking our budgets.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, a stinky box is worse. But if we just move it, we’re just passing the problem down the lane. I want us to still be able to talk to each other.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Rin, I’m not saying it’s easy. But I need to know if the time cost is worth it before I commit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the bin house fails. But the complaint log proves the current setup is unjust. We need a solution that distributes the burden fairly, not just hides the smell.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
